[thin] These opposite surfaces bound the actual 3.00 mm cantilever roof. All three R specimens retain this identical section while only the prepared support top distance differs. The stock is a removable finish/support comparison; it carries no appliance load or removal-life acceptance.
alternatives: A 4.00 or 6.00 mm roof provides more stock but changes bending/cooling and the support-removal comparison. A shorter unsupported span lowers bending without retaining the common 30 by 21 mm supported surface. A backed wall eliminates the cantilever at the cost of its three-sided removal access.
